{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"a98c6589-a783-4228-819e-07ad8a8f2d75","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required analytics events.\n\n- Added `import '../analytics.dart';` to both screens.  \n- Introduced `_emailStarted` and `_phoneStarted` flags.  \n- **RegistrationScreen**:  \n  - Email `onChanged` fires `registration_email_started` once.  \n  - Phone `onChanged` fires `registration_phone_started` once.  \n  - Slider `onChanged` fires `loan_amount_changed` with `amount`.  \n  - Terms checkbox fires `terms_accepted` when checked.  \n  - Continue button fires `registration_continue_tapped` with `amount` and `terms`.  \n- **OfferScreen**:  \n  - Converted to a `StatefulWidget` with a `ScrollController`.  \n  - Scroll listener captures `offers_scrolled` with `offset`.  \n\nAll events use the existing `Analytics.capture` wrapper and avoid sending PII.\n\nSee the detailed summary in the generated `ANSWER.md` artifact.\n","duration_seconds":754.148053,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":85920,"output_tokens":73467,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":2133184,"total_tokens":159387}}}
